        "created_at": "2017-03-06T13:50:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We're doing what we can.&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"> &nbsp;Now that there are farms of people actually creating accounts for spammers, it's a lot harder to deal with it. We're discussing options…</p>\n<p>Luckily, when a spam user creates multiple threads, we can delete them all when we delete the user, so it makes getting rid of them pretty easy. We just have to have a mod/admin around to do it.&nbsp;</p>",
